# Project authority

## Firebase (matches live console + `js/firebase.js`)

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| **GCP / Firebase project** | `homefinder-official` (console: HomeFinder-Official) |
| **Auth domain** | `homefinder-official.firebaseapp.com` |
| **Named Firestore database** | `homefinder` |
| **Hosting** | Firebase Hosting on this project (Spark plan as of console check) |

Do not call the **project** `homefinder` — that string is the **database id** only.

## Roles

Canonical roles: `owner`, `seeker`, `broker`, `staff`, `moderator`, `admin`  
Canonical field: `canonicalRole` (legacy `accountType` / `role` may appear as fallbacks in code)

## Listings data

- `propertyListings`
- `wantedListings`  
Legacy collection `properties` is retired.

## 3D

- Model: `master/HomeFinder.sh3d`
- SHA-256: `0e4d75bcedbf2d9827917cd61c01780d0c1d4ba9b852dbcac65ca63e8353cb34`
- Narrative: `docs/md/3d-authority.md`, `docs/md/camera-and-spatial-authority.md`

